  "title": "· TOP 10 | KYNBAG 2025 Bag Awards: Handbag Designs That Define the Era ·",
  "original_title": "TOP 10 | KYNBAG 2025年度包包大赏：定义时代的手袋设计",
  "excerpt": "The 2025 KYNBAG Awards spotlight 10 iconic handbags, celebrating design, creativity, craftsmanship, and cultural relevance.",
  "author": "撰稿 X Vivi 编辑 X RAN",
  "date_iso": "2026-02-14",
  "date_label": "February 14, 2026",
  "cover_image": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/e3c2463f1b15523d.jpg",
  "tags": [],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The 2025 KYNBAG Bag Awards are officially here. We've curated 10 of the most iconic handbags of the past year, reviewing the year's brightest stars in the bag world through design collaborations, creative inspiration, style evolution, craftsmanship, and the spirit of the times.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/27d0673c0062bf2c.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/27d0673c0062bf2c.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/ac608fd1aa6400ad.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/415bae1c3052434d.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2025 saw an unprecedented style shake-up in fashion, with over ten brands—including Chanel, Dior, Loewe, Balenciaga, and CELINE—welcoming new creative directors. The world's first Birkin handbag sold at Sotheby's Paris for €8.58 million (approx. ¥72 million), setting a new global auction record for handbags.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/54d9f25c7ebcbfdd.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/7072cc54c65e79d9.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "In 2025, art collaborations continued to bring avant-garde perspectives to bag design. Louis Vuitton revived its partnership with Takashi Murakami after 20 years, with the new Artycapucines handbag transforming the artist's iconic anime eyes and octopus tentacles into ornate bag embellishments, turning the handbag into a portable work of art.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/5d292d83d8fa7ac8.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/37f758f39def790d.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Playful proportions breathed new life into classic designs. Hermès' Sanglons evening bag reimagines the Kelly's signature turn-lock as an oversized central buckle, while CHANEL's four-color eyeshadow palette is scaled up into the dainty, whimsical Makeup Palette evening bag.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/582d8f7579bc385b.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/54753d4b755d0984.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Artisanal craftsmanship turned designers' wildest ideas into reality. Bottega Veneta used its signature leather weaving technique to craft a lifelike orange 🍊 bag, while FENDI repurposed leftover leather scraps into a playful fish-shaped bag.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/425dcfb4672a7974.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/0d5256037fc9f38b.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "In 2025, fashion found new life in nostalgia. Miu Miu's Solitaire top-handle bag reinterprets a 2013 archive style in glossy waxed leather. Prada's Galleria bag debuts an East-west silhouette suitable for shoulder carry, while playful animal prints transport us back to the maximalist Y2K era.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/85527d2bccad4af3.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/23542181a06c7aed.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Rebellion carved its own path. Balenciaga continued its irreverent street aesthetic with the Subway Bel Air bag, merging a hoodie with a bag. Saint Laurent used forged brass to create the enchanting Cœur heart-shaped evening bag, inspired by a heart brooch treasured by founder Yves Saint Laurent—rebellion with a tender touch.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/09fc2bef14cd25d8.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/448aa6750c6ef33b.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Elegance never goes out of style. CELINE's Antoinette bag features a classic frame-clasp structure with an arched top handle, its name evoking Queen Marie Antoinette and transporting us to the royal balls of Versailles.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· 01 ·Louis Vuitton Capucines MM Eye Bag",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/53cbc570b652defa.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/7d5e9d69a779dd42.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Louis Vuitton unveiled its Artycapucines VII collection with Japanese contemporary artist Takashi Murakami during the 2025 Paris+ par Art Basel. Using 3D resin printing, laser cutting, leather marquetry, hand-painting, and embroidery, Murakami's iconic smiling sunflowers, pandas, and octopus characters are transformed into exquisite bag embellishments, presenting the fantastical world of the artist's imagination.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/acbfe456f19e947b.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/857e0e2be8bd1d3d.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "caption",
      "text": "2025 Paris+ par Art Basel",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/1b6489de17764f4f.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/2e3bd950fe2e4bde.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Capucines MM Eye bag draws inspiration from Murakami's 2016 sculpture \"Mr. DOB (Original Edition).\" On a pale pink Taurillon leather body, an abstract facial expression is adorned: a round yellow nose and cute big eyes on the front, with a mouth appearing on the back. Each component is crafted from embossed smooth leather and embellished with glitter. The handles become curling octopus tentacles, while round ears pop out from the upper left—both structures made using 3D resin printing, then hand-polished and lacquered.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Magnified view: Click to enlarge for ultra-clear visual experience",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "grid",
      "text": null,
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/1fdb2c24aaee76a3.jpg",
          "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/97f2d8c54acc1e97.jpg",
          "price": ""
        },
        {
          "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/73b958b32628349a.jpg",
          "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/74c1941b83f060f3.jpg",
          "price": ""
        }
