    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/20adf90d027850c5.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/19698919e0dfe11f.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The bag also features a hidden detail: a round makeup mirror concealed inside the eye on the front, attached to the handle side ring via a metal chain. The chain and bag lining are adorned with green eye details, creating a surrealist touch.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/300d43546eb24302.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/e22833264c74add4.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "caption",
      "text": "Retail price ¥155,000 (Limited global edition of 85 pieces)",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· 02 ·Hermès Sanglons Cloutée Evening Bag",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Hermès' 2025 Fall/Winter collection introduces the Sanglons Cloutée evening bag, crafted from cream calfskin with a compact, boxy silhouette. The classic Kelly twist-lock transforms into an oversized metal buckle on the side, while polished palladium studs adorn the body, striking a balance between refinement and avant-garde edge.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Magnified view: Click to enlarge for ultra-clear visual experience",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/0b896ee30e03624f.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/98d7684b93331f42.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The oversized Kelly pivot buckle is the bag's most distinctive design element. First used on the 1930s Kelly bag, this circular openwork Touret turn-lock pairs with a square lock plate engraved with the Hermès logo. Simply rotate the pivot to open the flap—ingenious and ceremonial. Inside, the bag fits a phone and includes a small mirror.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/5e9a57444d0ae773.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/25261304a06eaedc.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/2702a926860344f9.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/2702a926860344f9.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The silver pivot buckle is made from palladium-plated brass and secured using Hermès' unique \"Pearling\" technique. The artisan cuts and hammers the rivet tip, then rounds it with a conical grinder and hand-polishes it until the fixing point is as smooth as a pearl, ensuring every metal piece is secure and silky to the touch.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/e575d60ab9c0f69f.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/369c1c072c0720b2.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "caption",
      "text": "Retail price ¥105,000",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· 03 ·Miu Miu Solitaire Bag",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/ec1cfeb07c968a47.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/ec1cfeb07c968a47.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Miu Miu Solitaire bag debuted on the 2025 Fall/Winter runway, inspired by an archive style from 2013. Its silhouette draws from vintage briefcases, with the standout feature being a symmetrical double-flap design on both front and back. Tubular leather double handles lend an elegant yet quirky air, while the all-black colorway exudes timeless sophistication.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "grid",
