      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The bag is crafted from glossy waxed calfskin, produced through tanning, dyeing, and waxing processes, resulting in a naturally wrinkled, lustrous vintage finish that deepens in character over time, growing more beautiful with age.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/b0ee919ffccf6099.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/367b5e79c525a45e.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "grid",
      "text": null,
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/9d1b396420285323.jpg",
          "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/07bb216cfa30b37c.jpg",
          "price": ""
        },
        {
          "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/5de531ea17c8147b.jpg",
          "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/f2e41d5d4eadb4a0.jpg",
          "price": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The front and back double-flap pockets and central compartment provide spacious, well-organized storage. A detachable strap allows for hand carry, shoulder carry, or crossbody wear, making it equally suited to scholarly ensembles or polished office looks.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
