    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· 04 ·CHANEL Makeup Palette Evening Bag",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/c6b787d15ebd673c.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/c6b787d15ebd673c.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/9765bcfed6e89f6e.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/1ecf8049e14cb8e1.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The CHANEL Makeup Palette evening bag vividly recreates the brand's four-color eyeshadow palette design. Crafted from black resin glass with a gold-tone frame, the four eyeshadow compartments feature three-dimensional curved surfaces with playful heart motifs, while a dedicated crystal eyeshadow wand sits on the right. Carrying it feels like a chic accessory for a Barbie doll.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Magnified view: Click to enlarge for ultra-clear visual experience",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "grid",
      "text": null,
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/be01d090cf6ee3fa.jpg",
          "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/0031f59250efabbe.jpg",
          "price": ""
        },
        {
          "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/2d1db1b76d3aa1b6.jpg",
          "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/346c3d0f17c1f4eb.jpg",
          "price": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Sparkling crystals and resin pearls outline signature CHANEL symbols: the brand name, double-C clasp, and number 5. The back features an oversized double-C logo encrusted with crystals. The bag comes with an arched handle of chain-embellished leather and a long chain that can be reversed for hand, shoulder, or crossbody wear. Inside, a small compact mirror completes the design—perfect for parties or galas, ensuring all eyes on you with a blend of elegance and playfulness.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
