    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Antoinette bag is a new addition to CELINE's Summer 2025 collection. Its name is inspired by Marie Antoinette, wife of King Louis XVI of France. The classic frame-clasp structure and arched top handle evoke the opulence of Versailles, perfectly aligning with the queen's love for courtly balls.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The architectural silhouette recalls the now-discontinued Clasp bag, with a metal frame and single handle, exuding simplicity and elegance. However, the Antoinette bag features curved edges and a rounded base, lending softer, more approachable lines and improved interior capacity.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
