          "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5oohtnt/3f02b0599736fe55.jpg",
          "price": "Clasp"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The top closure incorporates the new CELINE's most recognizable Triomphe logo, inspired by the chain surrounding the Place de l'Étoile and designed by founder Céline Vipiana in 1972. The matte calfskin body is dyed in a Bordeaux wine red, a deep hue between red and purple reminiscent of a rich, aromatic red wine—elegant and captivating.",
