    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Bottega Veneta Orange Multi-Pouch bag from the Summer 2025 collection showcases the brand's masterful leather craftsmanship and artisanal spirit through a playful fruit shape. Crafted in signature Intrecciato woven lambskin, the bag forms a plump, rounded orange 🍊 silhouette. The highlight: the bag can actually be peeled into four segments like a real orange, each with a zipper closure. The green leaf at the top cleverly doubles as the drawstring closure, with bright contrasting colors evoking fresh summer vibes.",
      "url": null,
