    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "True to BV's minimalist, logo-free aesthetic, the bag asserts its identity through the iconic Intrecciato weave, reflecting a confident brand philosophy. This leather technique dates back to 1975: artisans cut soft calfskin or lambskin into thin strips, then weave them into a fine grid pattern, enhancing the leather's flexibility. It requires about four times the material of ordinary assembly.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "caption",
