      "text": "The Saint Laurent Cœur heart-shaped evening bag pays homage to the heart motif beloved by founder Yves Saint Laurent. Crafted from forged brass in a three-dimensional heart shape, it features an embossed YSL Cassandre logo and a side kiss-lock closure that adds a romantic touch.",
