    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Since the brand's founding in 1962, the \"Cœur\" heart element has been a recurring motif in YSL accessories. Its inspiration comes from a ruby-encrusted heart brooch created by French jewelry designer Roger Scemama for Yves Saint Laurent's first couture show in 1958. It's said that for every haute couture show, YSL would pin this heart to his favorite look, treating it like a talisman.",
