    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The BALENCIAGA Subway Bel Air Carry All bag from the Summer 25 runway is inspired by Demna's vision of subway passengers casually stuffing clothes into their bags. A gray hoodie is literally attached to the top of the Bel Air bag, with the hoodie's zipper cleverly serving as the bag's opening, and the sleeves and hood dangling casually on the sides. This \"faux two-piece\" design exudes rebellious, playful street style.",
