      "text": "The bag body retains the Bel Air's signature design, crafted from supple natural grained calfskin with a nylon lining. The front leather flap hangs naturally for a carefree attitude, while the oversized silhouette offers \"almost impossible to fill\" storage space. The bag is named after Bel-Air, an upscale residential neighborhood in Los Angeles, California—home to some of America's most luxurious estates and lush vegetation, favored by Hollywood stars and business tycoons.",
